00:23:37.137 --> 00:23:41.640
So I have all of this
in my head all the time.

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.600
But I feel like if I--

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:45.860
This is my normal state.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.770
I think less than
this, I would start--

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:52.190
I think I'm probably one of
those puppies who you probably

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:55.100
