00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:58.220
so yeah, this is great.

00:23:58.220 --> 00:23:59.996
That's how I do it.

00:23:59.996 --> 00:24:05.350
I love to see how excited
you get about this too.

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:09.650
I mean, I want to plus a million
