00:24:48.580 --> 00:24:54.490
not because of the lines,
but because for me, because--

00:24:54.490 --> 00:24:56.290
Let me back up.

00:24:56.290 --> 00:24:58.840
What I try to do
for my-- and it does

00:24:58.840 --> 00:25:00.970
feed into all of this
stuff because I'm

00:25:00.970 --> 00:25:04.840
