that I'm trying to make possible

00:25:04.840 --> 00:25:07.940
through my group.

00:25:07.940 --> 00:25:12.330
So the purpose of the
group that I've created

00:25:12.330 --> 00:25:17.160
is to help people
build their own careers

00:25:17.160 --> 00:25:20.820
and also help the company help
