00:25:20.820 --> 00:25:22.760
more effectively.

00:25:22.760 --> 00:25:25.302
But you can learn
from other people

00:25:25.302 --> 00:25:27.760
about how you can build your
own career if you see how they

00:25:27.760 --> 00:25:29.367
built their careers, sometimes.

00:25:29.367 --> 00:25:31.450
You may be able to plug
and play different things,

00:25:31.450 --> 00:25:32.980
mix and match.

00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:34.720
And also hearing how
other people have

00:25:34.720 --> 00:25:38.535
done the data science
implementation

00:25:38.535 --> 00:25:39.910
in their own
respective projects,

00:25:39.910 --> 00:25:42.160
you may be able to also mix
and match as well, kind of

00:25:42.160 --> 00:25:44.620
like this series.

00:25:44.620 --> 00:25:47.710
But naturally, the way
I see the world though

00:25:47.710 --> 00:25:50.890
is like a combination
of The Matrix and Tron

00:25:50.890 --> 00:25:56.290
in that in The Matrix,
you see like all the guys

00:25:56.290 --> 00:25:59.445
that were looking at
the coding in the ship

00:25:59.445 --> 00:26:00.820
