running and causality and all

00:26:03.250 --> 00:26:03.842
of that stuff.

00:26:03.842 --> 00:26:05.800
And in Tron, the way the
light cycles go around

00:26:05.800 --> 00:26:08.292
and you kind of
see the story path.

00:26:08.292 --> 00:26:10.750
I mean I'm thinking in-- they're
called world lines from my

00:26:10.750 --> 00:26:12.430
studying from the novel.

00:26:12.430 --> 00:26:15.970
It's an object four-dimensional
path in space time.

00:26:15.970 --> 00:26:17.620
But that's how I
see everyone though.

00:26:17.620 --> 00:26:20.560
Every single person that I just
walked around in the world,

00:26:20.560 --> 00:26:23.510
it's like they have a Tron
light cycle path behind them.

00:26:23.510 --> 00:26:27.250
And so I want to understand
about their light cycle path,

00:26:27.250 --> 00:26:30.910
their world line because I
just think it's interesting.

00:26:30.910 --> 00:26:32.170
Everyone has a different path.

00:26:32.170 --> 00:26:34.390
I just think it's
interesting to know.

00:26:34.390 --> 00:26:36.530
But also, it can
help other people.

00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:38.970
So then I try to think
about how people--

00:26:38.970 --> 00:26:41.470
because I'm fusing that with
the data-driven decision making

00:26:41.470 --> 00:26:44.650
that I try to make it
possible for other people

00:26:44.650 --> 00:26:45.440
to learn about.

00:26:45.440 --> 00:26:47.440
And in order for people
to make decisions,

00:26:47.440 --> 00:26:49.300
they need the right
information that

00:26:49.300 --> 00:26:51.280
can help increase
their confidence

00:26:51.280 --> 00:26:54.380
beyond the threshold of stuck.

00:26:54.380 --> 00:26:58.270
So my brain is kind of always
running in the background,

00:26:58.270 --> 00:27:02.020
how do I reduce the activation
energy so that people

00:27:02.020 --> 00:27:06.940
can make decisions to get
engaged with the organization.

00:27:06.940 --> 00:27:10.390
And also what frustrated
me in the past?

00:27:10.390 --> 00:27:12.490
Why did I get frustrated
when I was at a meeting

00:27:12.490 --> 00:27:14.637
and I was like, I
don't care about this?

00:27:14.637 --> 00:27:15.970
This is not relevant to my life.

00:27:15.970 --> 00:27:17.950
So we have over 300
people in the group,

00:27:17.950 --> 00:27:20.950
but we don't always
have 300 people show up.

00:27:20.950 --> 00:27:24.370
We have like 50 to 60,
sometimes a little bit more.

00:27:24.370 --> 00:27:26.620
And that's because
part of the process

00:27:26.620 --> 00:27:28.270
that I do because
I'm always thinking

00:27:28.270 --> 00:27:31.630
about data driven decision
making but from a mushy side.

00:27:31.630 --> 00:27:33.670
Because actually, my father--

00:27:33.670 --> 00:27:35.480
