00:27:38.710 --> 00:27:41.870
And my mother is more like the
hardcore organizational career

00:27:41.870 --> 00:27:42.370
stuff.

00:27:42.370 --> 00:27:44.840
So that's the example
I saw my whole life.

00:27:44.840 --> 00:27:48.800
So because of that, I'm just
naturally doing both things.

00:27:48.800 --> 00:27:54.460
So every single thing that I do
is geared towards emotionally

00:27:54.460 --> 00:27:59.980
and logistically decreasing
the burden that people

00:27:59.980 --> 00:28:01.700
face when they're
trying to decide,

00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:03.230
